-109,g8-prep,g8-brief,evidence.body,,,g8-ev-contact-primer,"The last report tells us what was true when the crew sent it. Between tracking passes, we have no new information about their condition. Keep the report's observation time beside it; mark anything since that time as unconfirmed. The crew must act on their own until the next station acquires their signal.",
