-243,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,ui.prompt,Glen Kurtz — FLIGHT,,g8-return-brief,"Bring them down now and leave them waiting at sea, or keep them in orbit with less propellant for entry?",
-244,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,ui.hint,,,app,Unrehearsed does not mean untrained or incapable. Both orders remain available.,
-245,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,option.intent,,,g8-return-earlier,Bring them down at the earlier opportunity.,
-246,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,option.cost,,,g8-return-earlier,"The nearest ship is hours away. The crew will wait in the capsule at sea, in darkness, growing exhausted before pickup.",
-247,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,option.attraction,,,g8-return-earlier,Mara backs ending their time aboard the damaged spacecraft sooner.,
-248,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,option.uncertainty,,,g8-return-earlier,Confusion over the pickup call could leave them waiting even longer.,
-249,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,ui.label,,,app,Supported by,
-250,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,ui.text,,recovery rehearsal,app,Recovery rehearsal performed: READY,
-251,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,ui.text,,contact rehearsal,app,Contact rehearsal performed: READY,
-252,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,option.intent,,,g8-return-later,Take the later opportunity after one more orbit.,
-253,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,option.cost,,,g8-return-later,The crew stay aboard as their RCS propellant becomes critically low. Mara must get the warning and entry recommendation through promptly.,
-254,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,option.attraction,,,g8-return-later,Elias backs landing closer to the recovery force for a quicker pickup.,
-255,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,option.uncertainty,,,g8-return-later,A delayed warning or repeated instruction could force the crew to rush the entry preparations.,
-256,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,ui.text,,no systems rehearsal,app,Systems rehearsal performed: NOT REHEARSED,
-257,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,decision.hint,,,g8-return-brief,Ask Glen's questions and read each card's risks before choosing a return opportunity.,
-258,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,label,,,g8-return-brief,Recovery rehearsal,
-259,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,label,,any rehearsal,g8-return-brief,READY,
-260,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,label,,,g8-return-brief,Systems-warning rehearsal,
-261,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,label,,,g8-return-brief,NOT REHEARSED,
-262,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,label,,,g8-return-brief,Acknowledgement rehearsal,
-263,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,label,,,g8-prepared-recovery,Recovery rehearsal performed,
-264,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,label,,,g8-prepared-contact,Contact rehearsal performed,
-265,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,label,,,g8-prepared-systems,Systems rehearsal performed,
-266,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,evidence.body,,contact rehearsal,g8-ev-contact-readback,"CAPCOM has identified who sends the next instruction and who confirms its receipt. Until that confirmation comes back, FLIGHT will treat the instruction as pending. The same check applies to either return.",
-267,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,history-hidden,,contact rehearsal,g8-ev-contact-readback,"Automatic at planning only if contact preparation selected; F1/F7. Fiction register: F1, F7.",
-268,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,evidence.body,,recovery rehearsal,g8-ev-recovery-readback,"Elias and the DoD coordinator have agreed who sends the final pickup instruction to the ship. The readback is complete. This should prevent confusion during the approach, but the ship still has to reach the capsule.",
-269,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,history-hidden,,recovery rehearsal,g8-ev-recovery-readback,"Automatic at planning only if recovery preparation selected; F2/F7. Fiction register: F2, F7.",
-270,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,evidence.body,,,g8-ev-reserve,"The spacecraft is stable for now. The reentry control system, or RCS, uses small thrusters to control its attitude during entry. Propellant is limited; using more before entry leaves less for that task. Mara is checking the remaining supply.",
-271,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,history-hidden,,,g8-ev-reserve,Automatic at return planning; F7. This is not actual Gemini VIII telemetry. Fiction register: F7.,
-272,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,evidence.body,,,g8-ev-air,"Aircraft can support either return. At the earlier landing point, the nearest ship is hours away. At the later point, the recovery force can reach the capsule sooner.",
-273,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,history-hidden,,,g8-ev-air,"Automatic at return planning; F4/F7. No real coordinates or ships assigned. Fiction register: F4, F7.",
-274,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,evidence.body,,,g8-ev-return,"Both opportunities return the crew to the western Pacific. An earlier landing gets them off the damaged spacecraft sooner, but the ship is hours away. Another orbit brings them down closer to the recovery force, with less RCS propellant left for entry.",
-275,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,history-hidden,,,g8-ev-return,Automatic at return planning; F7 simulated planning report. Western Pacific historical context only is H2. Sources: H2. Fiction register: F7.,
-276,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,answer,Elias Reed — RECOVERY,,g8-q-recovery-risk,"The nearest ship is hours away. They'll be waiting in the capsule, in darkness, with the sea wearing them down. Air support helps, but it doesn't make the ship any closer.",
-277,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,ui.aria,,,app,Unpin: Aircraft and recovery ship positions,
-278,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,answer,Mara Voss — SYSTEMS,,g8-q-reserve-risk,"They'll spend another orbit in a damaged spacecraft. RCS propellant is already low; they need it to control their attitude during entry. If the warning or our instruction arrives late, they'll have less time to act.",
-279,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,answer,JIM LOVELL — CAPCOM,,g8-q-crew-return,"Hawaii relays that Armstrong has the spacecraft under control, drifting slowly with limited control. We've no crew request choosing between these two return opportunities.",
-280,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,evidence.title,,systems rehearsal,g8-ev-systems-readback,Warning call checked,
-281,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,ui.aria,,systems rehearsal,app,Pin: Warning call checked,
-282,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,ui.text,,no recovery rehearsal,app,Recovery rehearsal performed: NOT REHEARSED,
-283,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,ui.text,,systems rehearsal,app,Systems rehearsal performed: READY,
-284,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,evidence.body,,systems rehearsal,g8-ev-systems-readback,"Mara has checked the call with FLIGHT and CAPCOM. Both desks know to expect the RCS warning and her recommendation together, so CAPCOM can pass the instruction without waiting for the assessment to be repeated.",
-285,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,history-hidden,,systems rehearsal,g8-ev-systems-readback,"Automatic at planning only if systems preparation selected; F3/F7. Fiction register: F3, F7.",
-286,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,ui.text,,no contact rehearsal,app,Contact rehearsal performed: NOT REHEARSED,
-287,g8-recovery,g8-order-receipt,label,,,g8-order-receipt,Order receipt,
-288,g8-recovery,g8-order-receipt,briefing,,earlier,g8-order-receipt,"ORDER — Bring them down at the earlier opportunity.
