+92,prologue,prologue-g8-prologue-launch,prologue.title,,,g8-prologue-launch,16 MARCH 1966,
+93,prologue,prologue-g8-prologue-launch,prologue.caption,,,g8-prologue-launch,"The Agena launches first. A Titan II then lifts Armstrong and Scott from Cape Kennedy, beginning the chase toward their target in orbit.",
