+97,prologue,prologue-g8-prologue-inflection,prologue.caption,,,g8-prologue-inflection,"The spacecraft are joined, but Houston won't have continuous radio contact. The room will have to separate its last confirmed report from whatever happens beyond the next station's reach.",
