+111,g8-prep,g8-brief,briefing,,,g8-brief,"Armstrong and Scott will rendezvous and dock with Agena. Before launch, you have time for two extra ground rehearsals: short practice runs on the communications loops, with controllers passing a report or instruction and checking that the right desk received it. The crew's training and mission rules are already in place; these exercises prepare the people in your room to work together under pressure.",
