+122,g8-prep,g8-brief,evidence.body,,,g8-ev-contact-primer,"The last report tells us what was true when the crew sent it. Between tracking passes, we have no new information about their condition. Keep the report's observation time beside it; mark anything since that time as unconfirmed. The crew must act on their own until the next station acquires their signal.",
+123,g8-prep,g8-brief,history-hidden,,,g8-ev-contact-primer,Automatic at briefing; instructional reference grounded in H1. Sources: H1.,
+124,g8-prep,g8-brief,evidence.body,,,g8-ev-rule,"Both rings of the reentry control system have been activated to regain control, and substantial propellant has been used. Under these conditions, mission rules require termination. Cancel the remaining objectives and prepare a contingency return.",
+125,g8-prep,g8-brief,history-hidden,,,g8-ev-rule,Automatic at briefing; reference. Historical termination principle H2; game selection boundary F7. Sources: H2. Fiction register: F7.,
