+289,g8-recovery,g8-return-brief,answer,Elias Reed — RECOVERY,,g8-q-recovery-risk,"The nearest ship is hours away. They'll be waiting in the capsule, in darkness, with the sea wearing them down. Air support helps, but it doesn't make the ship any closer.",
