-387,g8-recovered,g8-lesson-decision,option.intent,,,g8-adopt-provenance,Make every report say what's been confirmed and what's still unknown.,
-388,g8-recovered,g8-lesson-decision,option.cost,,,g8-adopt-provenance,You can make only one procedure the standing requirement.,
-389,g8-recovered,g8-lesson-decision,option.attraction,,,g8-adopt-provenance,Give the room a clear record of what was known and when.,
-390,g8-recovered,g8-lesson-decision,option.uncertainty,,,g8-adopt-provenance,The next tracking pass may still leave important questions unanswered.,
-391,g8-recovered,g8-lesson-decision,option.intent,,,g8-adopt-recovery,"Put aircraft support, ship arrival, and confirmation of each on one recovery sheet.",
-392,g8-recovered,g8-lesson-decision,option.attraction,,,g8-adopt-recovery,Let the recovery desk check available help against the time the crew will spend at sea.,
-393,g8-recovered,g8-lesson-decision,option.uncertainty,,,g8-adopt-recovery,A correctly recorded request may still reach a ship too far away to help quickly.,
