+398,g8-recovered,g8-lesson-decision,label,,,g8-lesson-decision,Standing procedure,
+399,g8-recovered,g8-lesson-decision,ui.prompt,Glen Kurtz — FLIGHT,,g8-lesson-decision,Adopt one standing procedure.,
+400,g8-recovered,g8-lesson-decision,option.intent,,,g8-adopt-provenance,Make every report say what's been confirmed and what's still unknown.,
+401,g8-recovered,g8-lesson-decision,option.cost,,,g8-adopt-provenance,You can make only one procedure the standing requirement.,
+402,g8-recovered,g8-lesson-decision,option.attraction,,,g8-adopt-provenance,Give the room a clear record of what was known and when.,
+403,g8-recovered,g8-lesson-decision,option.uncertainty,,,g8-adopt-provenance,The next tracking pass may still leave important questions unanswered.,
+404,g8-recovered,g8-lesson-decision,option.intent,,,g8-adopt-recovery,"Put aircraft support, ship arrival, and confirmation of each on one recovery sheet.",
+405,g8-recovered,g8-lesson-decision,option.attraction,,,g8-adopt-recovery,Let the recovery desk check available help against the time the crew will spend at sea.,
+406,g8-recovered,g8-lesson-decision,option.uncertainty,,,g8-adopt-recovery,A correctly recorded request may still reach a ship too far away to help quickly.,
+407,g8-recovered,g8-lesson-decision,decision.hint,,,g8-lesson-decision,"Read what each procedure changes, then choose the one you want to carry into the next mission.",
