+412,g8-postflight,g8-accountability-brief,briefing,,,g8-accountability-brief,They came home. Now the argument moves from the flight room to the astronaut office. Some call the crew's judgment into question. Others ask what the ground failed to prepare for. Your position will tell the crews whether this room stands behind them when the checklist runs out.,
