-495,debrief,debrief,ui.label,,,app,Post-flight findings and disagreement,
-496,debrief,debrief,ui.label,,crew-blame,app,Glen's statement: “I agree with the criticism. Armstrong and Scott's handling of the emergency deserves the blame.”,
-497,debrief,debrief,ui.text,,,app,Neil Armstrong — Command Pilot,
-498,debrief,debrief,ui.hint,,q0 | crew-blame,app,Trust 0 → -2 · Confidence damaged,
-499,debrief,debrief,ui.hint,,crew-blame,app,Notes: Astronaut corps division deepened,
