-541,debrief,debrief,ui.hint,,q1,app,Trust 0 → -1 · Confidence strained,
-542,debrief,debrief,ui.hint,,later q1,app,Notes: Entry preparations delayed by a repeated call,
-543,debrief,debrief,followon.paragraph,,later,g9-systems-drill-required,The extra orbit left the crew facing entry with critically low RCS propellant. A systems-warning drill is required. Choose the other exercise.,
-544,debrief,debrief,debrief,,later,g8-db-later,You chose another orbit to land closer to the recovery force. The crew completed entry with critically low RCS propellant.,
-545,debrief,debrief,debrief,,not q2,g8-db-rework,Calls that needed clarification or repeating delayed the pickup or squeezed the crew's entry preparations. The crew-condition report records the result.,
-546,debrief,debrief,debrief,,later,g8-db-systems-next,Mara's response is recorded above. The next mission must include a systems-warning rehearsal; you'll choose its companion exercise.,
-547,debrief,debrief,debrief,,later,g8-db-departure-later,"Return timing — You took the later opportunity, as history did: Gemini VIII landed in the western Pacific on its seventh revolution and the crew awaited USS Leonard F. Mason. The propellant warning, the closer pickup, and the crew-condition sequence on this route are dramatized, not a reconstruction of that recovery.",
-548,debrief,debrief,label,,q1,trust_labels,Confidence strained,
-549,debrief,debrief,ui.hint,,earlier q1,app,Notes: Sea exhaustion — moderate,
-550,debrief,debrief,ui.hint,,later q2,app,Notes: Entry instruction confirmed promptly,
-551,debrief,debrief,debrief,,later & systems rehearsal,g8-db-warning-clean,The systems drill helped Mara get her warning to FLIGHT and CAPCOM together. She didn't have to repeat the assessment; the crew still had little RCS propellant left.,
-552,debrief,debrief,ui.hint,,later q0,app,Notes: Entry preparations rushed after two repeated calls,
-553,debrief,debrief,ui.hint,,earlier q0,app,Notes: Sea exhaustion — severe,
