-582,gemini-9a-briefing,g9-plan-decision,ui.label,,ground-accountability,app,"Ground contingency work commissioned. The crew's confidence in you has strengthened. The critics haven't withdrawn their objections; work on docked-flight contingency procedures is under way. Task: Docked-flight contingency development — Develop and rehearse procedures for emergencies while docked. List the symptoms the crew and ground can observe, agree who passes each warning, and prepare for a loss of contact before a diagnosis is complete.",
