+768,site,site-hero,site.paragraph,,,registry.site.hero.paragraph-03,Gemini VIII · Play in your browser,
+769,site,site-hero,site.label,,,registry.site.hero.label-01,"HOUSTON, TEXAS / 1966",
+770,site,site-hero,site.label,,,registry.site.hero.label-02,INDEPENDENT · STORY-DRIVEN · 2D,
+771,site,site-about,site.paragraph,,,registry.site.about.paragraph-01,01 / ABOUT THE GAME,
+772,site,site-about,site.heading,,,registry.site.about.heading-01,History sets the scene. Your decisions shape what follows.,
+773,site,site-about,site.paragraph,,,registry.site.about.paragraph-02,Take the flight director’s seat in a narrative game inspired by real missions and the people who made them possible.,
+774,site,site-about,site.paragraph,,,registry.site.about.paragraph-03,"You are Glen Kurtz: a fictional tribute to the legendary Gene Kranz, whose leadership helped guide Mission Control through pivotal moments of Gemini and Apollo. The signature vest is a nod to Kranz; Glen’s story is his own. Ageless by design, he represents generations of flight directors, from the earliest missions to those still ahead.",
+775,site,site-about,site.paragraph,,,registry.site.about.paragraph-04,"Listen to your controllers. Weigh incomplete information. Make the call, then live with its consequences. Follow the historical path or branch into an alternate outcome. The astronauts are real; the decisions and consequences blend documented events with clearly identified fiction.",
+776,site,site-about,site.label,,,registry.site.about.label-01,01,
+777,site,site-about,site.heading,,,registry.site.about.heading-02,Read the room.,
+778,site,site-about,site.paragraph,,,registry.site.about.paragraph-05,Your controllers see different risks. Ask questions and work through the evidence before you commit.,
+779,site,site-about,site.label,,,registry.site.about.label-02,02,
+780,site,site-about,site.heading,,,registry.site.about.heading-03,Make the call.,
+781,site,site-about,site.paragraph,,,registry.site.about.paragraph-06,Getting the crew home means weighing time in orbit against the conditions awaiting them at sea.,
+782,site,site-about,site.label,,,registry.site.about.label-03,03,
+783,site,site-about,site.heading,,,registry.site.about.heading-04,Carry the consequences.,
+784,site,site-about,site.paragraph,,,registry.site.about.paragraph-07,Your preparations and orders affect the return. Your response afterward shapes relationships and the next planning step.,
+785,site,site-demo,site.paragraph,,,registry.site.demo.paragraph-01,THE PLAYABLE DEMO,
+786,site,site-demo,site.heading,,,registry.site.demo.heading-01,GEMINI VIII The Weight of the Call,
+787,site,site-demo,site.paragraph,,,registry.site.demo.paragraph-02,A historic docking. A sudden emergency. Armstrong and Scott have brought their spacecraft back under control. Now your team must bring them home.,
+788,site,site-demo,site.paragraph,,,registry.site.demo.paragraph-03,"Prepare your controllers, weigh competing return risks, and face the consequences of your decision in the post-flight discussion.",
