+| 772 | site.heading |  |  | `registry.site.about.heading-01` | History sets the scene. Your decisions shape what follows. |
+| 773 | site.paragraph |  |  | `registry.site.about.paragraph-02` | Take the flight director’s seat in a narrative game inspired by real missions and the people who made them possible. |
+| 774 | site.paragraph |  |  | `registry.site.about.paragraph-03` | You are Glen Kurtz: a fictional tribute to the legendary Gene Kranz, whose leadership helped guide Mission Control through pivotal moments of Gemini and Apollo. The signature vest is a nod to Kranz; Glen’s story is his own. Ageless by design, he represents generations of flight directors, from the earliest missions to those still ahead. |
+| 775 | site.paragraph |  |  | `registry.site.about.paragraph-04` | Listen to your controllers. Weigh incomplete information. Make the call, then live with its consequences. Follow the historical path or branch into an alternate outcome. The astronauts are real; the decisions and consequences blend documented events with clearly identified fiction. |
